### Declare a virtual table (Track-1, OIDC bearer token)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/tables
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

{
  "tableName": "customers",
  "schema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "type": "object",
    "required": ["id", "tier"],
    "properties": {
      "id":   { "type": "string" },
      "tier": { "type": "string", "enum": ["bronze", "silver", "gold", "platinum"] }
    }
  }
}

### Ingest a single record (Track-2, API key)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/tables/customers/entries
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: dev-key

{
  "recordKey": "alice",
  "data": { "id": "alice", "tier": "gold" }
}

### Batch ingest used by the build-tool plugin (Track-2, LDAP Basic)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/tables/customers/entries:batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YnVpbGQtYm90OnMzY3JldA==

{
  "entries": [
    { "recordKey": "alice", "data": { "id": "alice", "tier": "platinum" } },
    { "recordKey": "bob",   "data": { "id": "bob",   "tier": "silver"   } }
  ]
}

### JSONB containment search
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/tables/customers/search?limit=20
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

{ "tier": "gold" }

### Version history
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/tables/customers/entries/alice/history
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

### Audit ledger — last 50 events for tenant
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

### Audit ledger — full trail for a single record (who/when/from→to)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/audit?tableName=customers&recordKey=alice&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

### Audit ledger — everything one actor did, across tables
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/audit?actor=build-bot
X-API-Key: dev-key

### Unicode / German characters round-trip (umlauts + ß)
# Demonstrates that the engine accepts and preserves non-ASCII characters
# (ä ö ü ß ÄÖÜ ẞ) verbatim through ingest → JSONB storage → search → audit.
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/tables/customers/entries
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
X-API-Key: dev-key

{
  "recordKey": "müller-jürgen",
  "data": {
    "id":          "müller-jürgen",
    "tier":        "gold",
    "displayName": "Jürgen Müller",
    "greeting":    "Schöne Grüße aus Köln! Straße: Hauptstraße 42, Größe: ẞ"
  }
}

### Read it back — the response body MUST contain the same UTF-8 bytes
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/tables/customers/entries/müller-jürgen
X-API-Key: dev-key

